        <p>The thirtieth annual meeting of the Borough of War rington Incorporated Permanent Building !Society was held at the office of the manager (Mr. Thomas Sutton), Legh-street, on Wednesday evening, Mr. John Andrew presiding. There were also present :—Messrs. H. Boughton, G. Holford, S. F. Welsby. T. H. A. Pilking- ton, W. D. Jeans, J. H. Clarke, J. G. Chappell, T. A. I Sutton, W. Caldwell, E A. Jones, W. Milner,nnd George ' Williams.</p>
