        <p>The Gentleworiatz says : "The alteration in price of the 6d. packet to sd. and of the i-lb. tin to 7?,d. is all the more pleasing when we can be assured that there will be no alteration whatever in the quality of the cocoa, and that the standard of purity for which Messrs. Cadbury's are famous will still be maintained.'</p>
